{
    "title": "Coppel Access",
    "description": "The Coppel Access app is a mobile wallet that lets you save, spend, and control your money, your way 24 hours per day. And the best part is you can create an account and download it using your Mexican identification! The Coppel Access mobile wallet was made to give you control over your money in a safe and trustworthy way. \r\n\r\nWith your Coppel Access mobile wallet, you can:\r\n-Save your money safely with the peace of mind knowing that your deposits are insured by the FDIC\r\n-See and control your spending anytime\r\n-Deposit cash to your account in more than 60,000 Visa ReadyLink locations\r\n-Deposit your checks from your phone\r\n-Receive direct deposit to your account\r\n-Send money to Mexico, or to family in the US without ever leaving home\r\n-Shop online or in person with your debit card without needing to carry cash\r\n\r\nAll of this with:\r\n-No minimum balance.\r\n-No monthly service fees.\r\n-No credit check.\r\n\r\nDownload today!\r\n\r\nContinuing Coppel\u2019s enduring dedication to the Mexican community, the Coppel Access mobile wallet further improves their financial lives in the US. With Coppel Access, now you have an account that lets you manage your money the way you want. Available only in the US.\r\n\r\nSome fees may apply. See terms and conditions for more details.\r\n\r\nBanking services are provided by Community Federal Savings Bank, Member FDIC. Mezu (NA), Inc. dba Alviere, is the program manager and a service provider of Community Federal Savings Bank.",
    "descriptionHTML": "The Coppel Access app is a mobile wallet that lets you save, spend, and control your money, your way 24 hours per day. And the best part is you can create an account and download it using your Mexican identification! The Coppel Access mobile wallet was made to give you control over your money in a safe and trustworthy way. <br><br>With your Coppel Access mobile wallet, you can:<br>-Save your money safely with the peace of mind knowing that your deposits are insured by the FDIC<br>-See and control your spending anytime<br>-Deposit cash to your account in more than 60,000 Visa ReadyLink locations<br>-Deposit your checks from your phone<br>-Receive direct deposit to your account<br>-Send money to Mexico, or to family in the US without ever leaving home<br>-Shop online or in person with your debit card without needing to carry cash<br><br>All of this with:<br>-No minimum balance.<br>-No monthly service fees.<br>-No credit check.<br><br>Download today!<br><br>Continuing Coppel\u2019s enduring dedication to the Mexican community, the Coppel Access mobile wallet further improves their financial lives in the US. With Coppel Access, now you have an account that lets you manage your money the way you want. Available only in the US.<br><br>Some fees may apply. See terms and conditions for more details.<br><br>Banking services are provided by Community Federal Savings Bank, Member FDIC. Mezu (NA), Inc. dba Alviere, is the program manager and a service provider of Community Federal Savings Bank.",
